  "findings": [
    "Eight authentic default invocations reproduce the frozen651 oracle hashes and sizes;the286 loaded reference sources rehash against retained authenticated archive source caps.",
    "Sort retains the complete historical arrow selector/value in a CSS variable fallback and appends the whole independently measured public color output. Tree preserves every historical rule and order,including literal Roboto font-family,and adds only five enumerated property fallbacks and the declared public dimensions.",
    "Progress inserts exactly six public current color aliases at three existing variant rules. Removing those six lines reconstructs the entire untouched4263-byte reference,including SVG,forced-color/media and keyframe CSS. No motion or product-source change was made in this task.",
    "The default indigo500,pinkA200,red500,2018 typography and density0 inputs are separate from configurable profiles;default Roboto and48px tree rows are explicitly bound. Current m2 constructors appear only in independent peer oracle programs;the facade continues to own historical16 constructors.",
    "Both exact minimum Material/CDK identities,public programs,whole peer output and complete186/185 loaded peer source graphs are required. Candidate producer measurements bind the authentic invocation,compiler and owned/peer source caps.",
    "Actual runSassApiCss,compareInventory and apiAssertionBody paths pass eight cases per branch. The diagnostic reuses authentic inventory member metadata without executing variable/signature discovery and uses a synthetic non-artifact envelope;these results do not qualify the full651 cases.",
    "Presence-based metadata dispatch rejects null current-companion/current-infrastructure metadata as well as unknown and conflicting metadata;ordinary exact comparisons retain their full roster."
  ],
  "negative_tests": [
    "Rehashed unrelated rules,scope changes,removed owned CSS,changed fallback/default profile/font-family/density and modified aliases fail whole-CSS admission.",
    "Changed progress keyframe names,forced-color declarations or removed SVG declarations fail,even with recomputed output hash/size.",
    "Wrong line/program/compiler/original bytes or digest,minimum peer versions/manifests,missing/altered loaded inputs and modified peer CSS fail.",
    "Wrong run,invocation,library,oracle,binding,result/exit or missing/conflicting metadata fail actual coordinator admission. Boolean byte counts are rejected.",
    "All651 identifiers remain in pure comparisons;changing any of the eight finite cases leaves that case failed. Unexecuted entries in this pure validator test are synthetic baseline copies."
  ],
